              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ key I-thɛ-rɛl luɔc jɔk ni cothä nath kä Lɛbo-ɣä-mat aräth ni baar Ä-ra-ba, ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, mëë cɛ lat kɛ thok jäŋädɛ ni Jona gat Ä-mi-tay min gök, raan Gɛ̈th-ɣe-pɛr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ci Kuoth Nhial riɛk I-thɛ-rɛl nɛn cɛ bɛ̈c ɛlɔ̱ŋ, thilɛ ram mi ci duɔth kä di̱eel wec kiɛ ja̱ŋ, kä thilɛ mi bi I-thɛ-rɛl luäk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö /ken Kuoth Nhial ɛ lar i̱ bi kɛk I-thɛ-rɛl bath wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n. Inɔ cuɛ kɛ kän kɛ Ya-rɔ-baam gat Yɛ-ɣo-ac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
